# SDD 1/6 — Video Pipeline Specs & Economics

**Data:** 16 de Abril de 2026  
**Módulo:** Production Tier Architecture  
**Responsável:** Thiago do Carmo  
**Status:** ✅ Implemented

-----

## 1. Sistema de Tiers — Especificação Completa

### Tier 1: HeyGen Creator ($24/mês)

**Propósito:** Depoimentos premium com avatar realista

```yaml
Specifications:
  Video Type: Avatar testimonials, voice-over narration
  Duration: 15-30 segundos
  Quality: 1080p, 60fps, lip-sync preciso
  Avatar Options: 100+ avatares, custom clone possível
  Voice: 200+ vozes em 50+ idiomas
  Background: Customizável (solid, image, video)
  
Production Flow:
  1. Escreve script (50-80 palavras)
  2. Coloca em HeyGen template
  3. Seleciona avatar + voz (EN ou PT-BR)
  4. Gera video (2-3 min)
  5. Download MP4 + upload PostForMe
  
Timing:
  Setup: 1 min
  Script: 2 min
  Generation: 2-3 min
  Total: ~6 min
  
Cost per Video: $12 ($24/2 vídeos default cap)
Monthly Allocation: 2-3 videos/mês (premium)
Ideal For:
  - Customer testimonials (Roberts, All Granite)
  - Founder/CEO messaging (DockPlus AI)
  - Expert explains (Cheesebread chef, Cape Codder designer)
  
Storage:
  Files: ~/.claude/video-assets/heygen/
  Format: MP4 (pronto para PostForMe)
```

-----

### Tier 2: fal.ai Kling 3.0 ($20/mês)

**Propósito:** Clipes dinâmicos cinematográficos

```yaml
Specifications:
  Model: Kling 3.0 (fal.ai hosted)
  Input: Text prompt (descrição visual + style)
  Output: MP4 video, 15-60 segundos
  Resolution: 720p-1080p (aspect 9:16 para Reels)
  Frame Rate: 24-30fps
  Batch: Até 5 vídeos/mês no $20 tier
  
Pricing:
  Cost per video: $0.029/seg × 30seg = $0.87/video
  15sec video: $0.44
  60sec video: $1.74
  Monthly: ~$20 (alerta se > $20)
  
Production Flow:
  1. Escreve prompt visual (50-100 palavras)
     Exemplo: "Aerial drone shot of finished granite 
              countertop in modern kitchen, golden hour 
              lighting, cinematic slow-mo, 4K"
  2. Submete para fal.ai via API
  3. Aguarda generation (2-5 min)
  4. Download MP4
  5. Trim/edit no Remotion se necessário
  6. Upload PostForMe
  
Kling 3.0 Prompts (por empresa):
  Roberts Landscape:
    - "Wide shot of completed driveway, before-after split"
    - "Landscape crew working, time-lapse, golden hour"
    - "Hardscape transformation, aerial drone view"
  
  All Granite & Stone:
    - "Granite slab textures, close-up, light play"
    - "Countertop installation, ASMR detail shots"
    - "Stone colors matching to kitchen design"
  
  Cape Codder Home Improvement:
    - "Kitchen renovation before/after slider"
    - "Bathroom tile installation, close-up"
    - "Framing work progress, time-lapse"
  
  Cheesebread:
    - "Artisan bread baking, close-up macro"
    - "Espresso machine pouring, ASMR detail"
    - "Café interior ambiance, warm lighting"
  
  DockPlus AI:
    - "AI automation workflow visualization"
    - "Dashboard screens, data flow animation"
    - "Team collaboration, futuristic aesthetic"

Storage:
  Files: ~/.claude/video-assets/kling3/
  Prompts: .claude/prompts/kling3-per-company.md
  Generated: Synced to Supabase on completion
```

