### Tier 3: Remotion (GRÁTIS)

**Propósito:** Compilação, animação tipográfica, montagem

```yaml
Specifications:
  Framework: Remotion + React + TypeScript
  Cost: FREE (self-hosted, local render)
  Resolution: 1080×1920 (9:16 Reels)
  Duration: 15-60 segundos
  Format: MP4 H.264 codec
  
Templates Built (5):
  1. Before-After-Reveal
     - Split screen + animated slider
     - Ease-in/out transition
     - Branded watermark
     - Timing: 30 seg
  
  2. Service Showcase
     - 4-panel grid (progress)
     - Service icons + animations
     - Descriptive text overlay
     - Timing: 30 seg
  
  3. Testimonial Quote Card
     - Avatar + stars rating
     - Rotating quotes
     - Brand colors accent
     - Timing: 20 seg
  
  4. Educational Tips
     - 3 tips in carousel style
     - Icons + animated text
     - Call-to-action ending
     - Timing: 45 seg
  
  5. Promo/Offer
     - Countdown timer (optional)
     - Discount badge pulse
     - CTA button animated
     - Timing: 15 seg
  
Production Flow:
  1. Select template (TSX file)
  2. Replace brand assets (logo, colors, fonts)
  3. Populate data (text, images, theme)
  4. npm run build:video
  5. Outputs MP4 to /out
  6. QA check (2 min)
  7. Upload PostForMe
  
File Structure:
  ./remotion-templates/
    ├── before-after-reveal.tsx
    ├── service-showcase.tsx
    ├── testimonial-quote.tsx
    ├── educational-tips.tsx
    ├── promo-offer.tsx
    ├── styles/
    │   ├── brands.ts (Roberts, Cheesebread, etc)
    │   ├── animations.ts
    │   └── colors.ts
    └── assets/
        ├── logos/
        ├── fonts/
        └── backgrounds/
  
Brand Presets:
  Roberts Landscape:
    Primary: #2D5016 (forest green)
    Secondary: #8B7355 (brown)
    Accent: #F5A623 (orange)
    Font: Poppins Bold
  
  Cheesebread Bakery:
    Primary: #D4A574 (warm tan)
    Secondary: #8B6F47 (brown)
    Accent: #FFE5CC (cream)
    Font: Playfair Display
  
  Cape Codder Home Improvement:
    Primary: #0055A8 (navy)
    Secondary: #F8A100 (gold)
    Accent: #E8E8E8 (light gray)
    Font: Montserrat
  
  All Granite & Stone:
    Primary: #4A4A4A (dark gray)
    Secondary: #8B8B8B (medium gray)
    Accent: #D4AF37 (gold)
    Font: Raleway
  
  DockPlus AI:
    Primary: #1E1E2E (dark terminal)
    Secondary: #00FF00 (neon green)
    Accent: #00FFFF (cyan)
    Font: JetBrains Mono
  
Render Performance:
  Duration: 30sec video = 2-3 min render (M1/M2)
  Format: H.264 (ffmpeg)
  Bitrate: 5000 kbps (Instagram recommended)
  File size: ~20-30 MB per 30sec
  
Storage:
  Local: ~/.claude/video-assets/remotion/
  Cache: ./node_modules/.remotion-cache/
  Outputs: ./out/
  Archive: Synced to S3/Supabase
```

