### Tier 4: Image Assets ($5.75/mês Freepik)

**Propósito:** Stock backgrounds, textures, B-roll

```yaml
Freepik Essential Plan:
  Cost: $5.75/mês
  Downloads: Unlimited HD images/videos
  Vectors: Unlimited
  Exclusive content: Freepik Premier library
  
Unsplash (Grátis, Primary):
  Cost: FREE
  Downloads: Unlimited high-quality photos
  Attribution: Appreciated but optional
  Collections: By company/theme
  
Usage:
  Priority: Unsplash first (free)
  Secondary: Freepik when Unsplash lacking
  Fallback: AI-generated via fal.ai
  
Download Workflow:
  1. Search term in Unsplash API
  2. Filter by color, orientation, style
  3. Cache locally to /assets/images/
  4. Use in Remotion template
  
Organized By Company:
  ~/.claude/video-assets/images/
    ├── roberts-landscape/
    ├── cheesebread/
    ├── cape-codder/
    ├── all-granite/
    └── dockplus-ai/

Storage Limit:
  Max per company: 500 MB (unused cleanup monthly)
  Format: JPG/PNG optimized (tinypng)
```

