## 2. Monthly Budget Breakdown

```
April 2026 Allocation: $200 Hard Cap

Week 1 ($49.75):
  HeyGen:      $24.00  (2 videos)
  fal.ai:      $20.00  (5 videos, ~$4/video)
  Remotion:    $0.00   (8 videos)
  Freepik:     $5.75   (1 month prorated)
  ─────────────────────
  Subtotal:    $49.75
  Remaining:   $150.25

Optional Add-ons (if < $150):
  □ Sora video generation ($1-5 per video)
  □ ComfyUI API access ($10-50 monthly)
  □ Music licensing (Epidemic/Artlist) ($8-14)
  □ Professional editing software trial

Cap Management:
  Alert @ 80%: $160 spent (16/04)
  Alert @ 90%: $180 spent (23/04)
  Hard stop:   $200 spent (30/04)
  
If Over Budget:
  - Next week forced to Tier 3 only (Remotion free)
  - Or skip 1-2 HeyGen videos
  - Or reduce fal.ai batch to 3 (save $6)
```

-----

## 3. Quality Standards per Tier

|Aspecto                  |Tier 1                        |Tier 2               |Tier 3             |
|-------------------------|------------------------------|---------------------|-------------------|
|**Rendering Quality**    |1080p, 60fps                  |720p-1080p, 24fps    |1080p, 30fps       |
|**Encoding**             |H.264, verified UTF-8         |H.264, no artifacts  |H.264, optimized   |
|**Color Grading**        |Avatar default + white balance|Kling AI color grade |Manual color adjust|
|**Audio**                |HeyGen voice synthesis OR     |Optional music bed   |Optional music bed |
|**Motion Graphics**      |Lip-sync + subtle background  |Full cinematic motion|Custom animations  |
|**Brand Consistency**    |90% (limited customization)   |85% (AI generated)   |100% (controlled)  |
|**Acceptable Error Rate**|0.5% (encoding)               |2% (generation)      |0% (local render)  |

-----

## 4. Fallback Strategies

### If HeyGen Down/Over Quota

```
Primary: Use Tier 2 fal.ai
  → Prompt: "Professional spokesperson explaining [topic]"
  → Avatar: Kling AI avatar if available
  
Fallback: Use Tier 3 Remotion
  → Template: Testimonial-quote with text overlay
  → Music: Royalty-free from Epidemic
  → Voice: None (text-only, save audio cost)
```

### If fal.ai Down

```
Primary: Use Tier 3 Remotion
  → Template: Service-showcase with stock images
  → Motion: Faster animations to compensate
  
Fallback: Use HeyGen avatar + narration
  → Combine Tier 1 + Remotion compilation
  → Extra time (+5 min)
```

### If Internet Down (Remotion Local Render)

```
Remotion can render offline:
  1. Template + assets cached locally
  2. npm run build:video --no-internet
  3. Outputs to /out/ locally
  4. Upload when connection restored
```

