```yaml
Tracking Sheet: ~/.claude/metrics/video-tier-performance.csv

Columns:
  - Date
  - Company
  - Tier(s) Used
  - Video Length (sec)
  - Generation Time (min)
  - File Size (MB)
  - Cost ($)
  - Status (✅ or 🔴)
  - Notes
  
Example:
  2026-04-16, Roberts, Tier2, 30, 3.5, 28, 0.87, ✅, "Drone footage"
  2026-04-16, Cheesebread, Tier1+3, 45, 6.0, 35, 12.00, ✅, "Chef narration"
  
Dashboard (monthly):
  Total videos: [count]
  Total cost: $[X]
  Avg cost/video: $[Y]
  Tier breakdown: [pie chart]
  Success rate: [X%]
  
Alerting:
  If cost > $50/week → Slack alert
  If success rate < 95% → Investigation
  If render time > 10 min → Optimization needed
```

