## 6. Integração com Skills

### credit-budget-tracker → Tier Selection Logic

```
IF budget_remaining > $25:
  PRIMARY_TIER = 1 + 2 + 3 (flexible)
ELIF budget_remaining > $10:
  PRIMARY_TIER = 2 + 3 (skip HeyGen)
ELIF budget_remaining > $5:
  PRIMARY_TIER = 3 (Remotion only)
ELSE:
  PRIMARY_TIER = 3 (Remotion free)
  WARN: "Budget nearly exhausted, next reset May 1"
```

